{
  "format": "live-deck",
  "version": 1,
  "id": "live-demo-multi-panel",
  "title": "同一现场，三个视角",
  "terminals": {
    "runner": {
      "label": "01 · 运行命令",
      "cwd": "{{LIVE_DECK_WORKSPACES}}/multi-run",
      "commands": [
        {
          "id": "prepare",
          "title": "准备日志文件",
          "command": ": > live-demo.log",
          "note": "先在空闲的 Shell 提示符执行。之后启动日志观察。"
        },
        {
          "id": "run",
          "title": "运行 60 秒，持续产生输出",
          "command": "python3 -u -c 'import time; f=open(\"live-demo.log\", \"a\", buffering=1); [(print(s := f\"tick={i} time={time.time():.3f}\", flush=True), f.write(s+\"\\n\"), time.sleep(1)) for i in range(60)]'",
          "note": "执行后可以继续切换面板、看图表。示例输出不代表 Grafana 看板的业务负载。"
        },
        {
          "id": "check",
          "title": "执行结束后核对结果",
          "command": "wc -l live-demo.log",
          "note": "等命令结束，或 Ctrl+C 停止后，再输入下一条。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "logs": {
      "label": "03 · 实时日志",
      "cwd": "{{LIVE_DECK_WORKSPACES}}/multi-logs",
      "commands": [
        {
          "id": "follow",
          "title": "持续跟随日志",
          "command": "tail -n 20 -F {{LIVE_DECK_WORKSPACES}}/multi-run/live-demo.log",
          "note": "保持运行；Ctrl+C 结束日志跟随。"
        },
        {
          "id": "last",
          "title": "查看最后 10 行",
          "command": "tail -n 10 {{LIVE_DECK_WORKSPACES}}/multi-run/live-demo.log",
          "note": "先 Ctrl+C 退出 tail -F，再执行。"
        },
        {
          "id": "count",
          "title": "检查日志行数",
          "command": "wc -l {{LIVE_DECK_WORKSPACES}}/multi-run/live-demo.log"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "dashboards": {
    "metrics": {
      "label": "02 · Grafana",
      "url": "https://grafana.example.com/d/my-dashboard/overview?from=now-15m&to=now&kiosk=1&refresh=10s",
      "commands": [
        {
          "id": "recent",
          "title": "观察最近 15 分钟",
          "command": "https://grafana.example.com/d/my-dashboard/overview?from=now-15m&to=now&kiosk=1&refresh=10s",
          "note": "示例为 Grafana 看板。替换为本次 demo 对应服务的 dashboard / panel 链接。首次使用可点新窗登录。"
        },
        {
          "id": "hour",
          "title": "切换到最近 1 小时",
          "command": "https://grafana.example.com/d/my-dashboard/overview?from=now-1h&to=now&kiosk=1&refresh=10s"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "slides": [
    {
      "type": "slide",
      "title": "同一现场，三个视角。",
      "kicker": "LIVE DECK / MULTI-PANEL",
      "markdown": "运行命令、观察图表、跟随日志，保持在同一个画面。\n\n每个面板有自己的候选池；**顶部总顺序**提示下一步该切到哪里。点候选只选择，填入后仍由你按回车执行。",
      "id": "opening"
    },
    {
      "type": "workspace",
      "title": "运行 · 指标 · 日志",
      "panels": [
        "runner",
        "metrics",
        "logs"
      ],
      "layout": "columns",
      "id": "live-metrics"
    },
    {
      "type": "slide",
      "title": "回到讲解，进程继续运行。",
      "markdown": "翻页保留终端连接和 Shell 状态。下一页复用这三个面板。\n\n总顺序可以跳过、回退；临时操作后，点顶部 **下一步** 返回计划。",
      "id": "continue-talk"
    },
    {
      "type": "workspace",
      "title": "继续观察同一组会话",
      "panels": [
        "runner",
        "metrics",
        "logs"
      ],
      "layout": "focus",
      "id": "observe-again"
    }
  ],
  "sequence": [
    {
      "panel": "runner",
      "command": "prepare"
    },
    {
      "panel": "logs",
      "command": "follow"
    },
    {
      "panel": "runner",
      "command": "run"
    },
    {
      "panel": "metrics",
      "command": "recent"
    },
    {
      "panel": "metrics",
      "command": "hour"
    },
    {
      "panel": "runner",
      "command": "check"
    },
    {
      "panel": "logs",
      "command": "last"
    }
  ]
}
